Subject: [PATCH 28/32] chartdldr_pi: iOS layout

Layout of the downloader pages on a phone, chart directories in the app's
Documents folder, and the paths shown relative to it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
